WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:100%,end
Ask the assistant opens the support bot.
It guides you in using the app.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000 line:100%,end
Write the question in your own language.
The bot answers in the same language.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000 line:100%,end
Ask, for example, how to do a function.
Press Send.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000 line:100%,end
The answer comes step by step,
based on the app’s own instructions.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000 line:100%,end
The AI assistant can be wrong.
Check important points in the help center.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:44.000 line:100%,end
The bot does not answer questions about the technical implementation.
You can ask 20 questions a day.
